OL,3,CMore than 150 plants destroyed after
OL,4,Ccannabis farm discovered in property
OL,6,FMore than 150 cannabis plants found at
OL,7,Fa property in Bournemouth in Dorset
OL,8,Fhave been destroyed.
OL,10,FOfficers from Dorset Police
OL,11,FNeighbourhood Police team were alerted
OL,12,Fto a property in the Kinson area of
OL,13,Fthe city where they discovered a
OL,14,Fcannabis factory.
OL,16,FPolice say more than 150 plants were
OL,17,Ffound.
OL,19,FThe cannabis factory has now been
OL,20,Fdismantled and an investigation is in
OL,21,Fprogress.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/3
