OL,3,CMore than 150 plants destroyed after
OL,4,Ccannabis farm discovered in property
OL,6,FThe plants have also now been
OL,7,Fdestroyed.
OL,9,FA Dorset Police spokesperson said: "As
OL,10,Falways we thank the local community
OL,11,Ffor their help and information.
OL,13,F"Please continue to report suspicious
OL,14,Fbehaviour and local concerns to the
OL,15,FNeighbour Police team and 101."
OL,17,FAnyone found with cannabis by police
OL,18,Fwill have it confiscated, and those
OL,19,Ffound smoking in public will be
OL,20,Farrested.
